"w":5804,"n":35,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/23/balchem-bcpc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[2,2,0,3.51],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.036,"r5":-0.0397,"r1_spy":-0.0432,"r5_spy":-0.0341}}],"quotes":[{"c":"BCPC 2018 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2018-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"I'll take the tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/balchem-corp-bcpc-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"BCPC 2018 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2018-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"The direct impact on Balchem and really when I think about tariffs, I think about direct impact being products that we buy from China that have increased in price because of the tariffs versus indirect, which is -- good example is soybeans have fallen and soybean meal is a competitive product to…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/balchem-corp-bcpc-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"BCPC 2018 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2018-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"We still think that, that's a reasonable value of the total impact and then trying to offset that through buying from other countries and/or raising prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/balchem-corp-bcpc-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"BCPC 2019 Q1","e":"bcpc","d":"2019-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Brett Hundley","x":"Particularly because it coincides with commentary that I'm hearing from other ingredient players about larger food and beverage customers starting to come back to suppliers and talk about innovation again and focus on building new products after just years of cost cutting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/balchem-corp-bcpc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCPC 2019 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2019-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"…China has driven significant business to date, but we do believe that that is coming and should be a benefit to us in coming quarters both on the hog side as well as the poultry side and And as poultry and swine tariffs are eliminated in China that will only fuel further opportunity for growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/balchem-corp-bcpc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCPC 2019 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2019-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"But our bigger concern, I would have to say is just around the learnings that the industry has had around cost reduction through this difficult period and the recycling of processed water and the fluids that are used in fracking, the reduction in additives that seems to be impacting us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/05/balchem-corp-bcpc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCPC 2019 Q4","e":"bcpc","d":"2020-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"The increase was principally due to incremental operating expenses related to the Chemogas and Zumbro acquisitions, increased transaction and integration costs, higher bad debt expense and a non-cash restructuring charge in the Human Nutrition and Health segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/balchem-corp-bcpc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCPC 2019 Q4","e":"bcpc","d":"2020-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin Bengtsson","x":"…higher bad debt expenses largely attributable to the Dean Foods bankruptcy and a non-cash restructuring charge associated with the exiting of a small underperforming product line, partially offset by the aforementioned higher sales. Excluding the effect of noncash expense associated with…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/balchem-corp-bcpc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCPC 2020 Q2","e":"bcpc","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mitra Ramgopal","x":"And Ted, a lot of companies are obviously reevaluating their businesses and some restructuring, what have you.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/01/balchem-corp-bcpc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCPC 2020 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martin Bengtsson","x":"From an efficiency standpoint, I wouldn't say that we're baking in and expecting huge cost savings, et cetera.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/balchem-corp-bcpc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2020 Q4","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"This is one business that we do have relatively good ability to raise prices, but it takes about a quarter or so to really get the full increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/balchem-corp-bcpc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2020 Q4","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mitra Ramgopal","x":"And I was just curious in terms of your ability of what you're still seeing with raw material costs this year thus far and your ability to maybe mitigate the impact via price increases or other initiatives?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/19/balchem-corp-bcpc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q1","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin Bengtsson","x":"We have arrangements in place to recover a significant portion of the raw material increases through price increases to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/01/balchem-corp-bcpc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q1","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin Bengtsson","x":"So we're really more focused on how do we take these increased costs and turn around and effectively pass them through to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/01/balchem-corp-bcpc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q2","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-07-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Theodore L. Harris","x":"Kathy brings to the Balchem Board, important new product development and direct-to-consumer expertise, along with her international business acumen and experience in driving a growth culture.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/balchem-corporation-bcpc-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q2","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Carl Martin Bengtsson","x":"No, maybe the only thing I would add there is that our human business are the ones that have been best enabled to date to also pass-through the raw material increases to their customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/balchem-corporation-bcpc-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q2","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Carl Martin Bengtsson","x":"And we've passed through a lot of that, not all of it, we passed through in terms of pricing, call it about $7 million of this.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/balchem-corporation-bcpc-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q2","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Martin Bengtsson","x":"But I would not call that out as the key big driver of trying to take cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/balchem-corporation-bcpc-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"We will continue to focus on dampening the impacts of these challenges, by leveraging our global supply chain capabilities and redundancies to ensure continuity of production, while raising prices where we can to offset the extraordinary input cost inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/balchem-corporation-bcpc-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin Bengtsson","x":"As such, we have and we'll continue to work hard to recover these cost increases by passing them through to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/balchem-corporation-bcpc-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2021-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"Research was presented in collaboration with Albern University that demonstrated the value of restructuring proteins derived from animal code products for the manufacturer of highly nutritious treats.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/balchem-corporation-bcpc-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q4","e":"bcpc","d":"2022-02-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"So she brings to the Balchem Board importance, new product development, and direct-to-consumer experience along with our international business acumen and ability to build a growth culture.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/18/balchem-bcpc-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q4","e":"bcpc","d":"2022-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin Bengtsson","x":"And in the fourth quarter, we passed through approximately $19 million in price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/18/balchem-bcpc-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2021 Q4","e":"bcpc","d":"2022-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin Bengtsson","x":"As we've shared before, there's usually a timing difference of approximately one to two quarters between increased costs and our ability to raise prices, resulting in a negative impact to our gross margin in the interim period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/18/balchem-bcpc-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2022 Q1","e":"bcpc","d":"2022-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"Our customers are, in turn, raising prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/29/balchem-bcpc-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2022 Q1","e":"bcpc","d":"2022-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin Bengtsson","x":"The growth was driven both by increased volumes and increased average selling prices as we continue to recapture higher input costs by raising prices in this inflationary environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/29/balchem-bcpc-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2022 Q2","e":"bcpc","d":"2022-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"We're really pleased with the market positions that we have that have allowed us, by and large, to raise prices and recover the majority of our input costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/29/balchem-bcpc-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2022 Q2","e":"bcpc","d":"2022-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ted Harris","x":"We're continuing to raise prices selectively.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/29/balchem-bcpc-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2025 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2025-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Theodore Lee Harris","x":"To date, we have managed to fully offset the impact of tariffs associated with the U.S. Administration's evolving trade policy, either through alternate supply chain options or subsequent pricing actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/21/balchem-bcpc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2025 Q3","e":"bcpc","d":"2025-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Theodore Lee Harris","x":"And based on what we know today, we expect to similarly be able to offset any impact of future tariffs as the trade situation further evolves.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/21/balchem-bcpc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2025 Q4","e":"bcpc","d":"2026-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Ted Harris","x":"We navigated a dynamic global trade and tariff environment in a disciplined and proactive way.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/20/balchem-bcpc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2025 Q4","e":"bcpc","d":"2026-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Ted Harris","x":"We offset tariff impacts through a combination of alternate supply chain options and pricing actions, and we have remained nimble as conditions evolved.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/20/balchem-bcpc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2025 Q4","e":"bcpc","d":"2026-02-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ted Harris","x":"But also our strong market positions allowed us, where we had to, to raise prices to offset any tariffs that we ended up having to pay.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/20/balchem-bcpc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCPC 2026 Q1","e":"bcpc","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ted Harris","x":"We will once again leverage our robust global supply chain, our procurement expertise, and our strong market positions to raise prices where necessary to help manage through this dynamic market environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/balchem-bcpc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BC